exports[`the PII gate guarantee (commit boundary) given: [case3] a clean staged set, husky runtime absent when: [t0] a normal commit is attempted then: the output a committer reads matches its snapshot 1`] = `
"── stdout ──
[<branch> <sha>] test
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
 create mode 100644 note.md

── stderr ──

🦅 clear skies,

🔎 pii.scan
   ├─ scope: diffs since-staged
   ├─ files: 1
   └─ hits: 0
stub reviewer: exit 0
🟡 husky not available, the rest of the chain is skipped
🟡 husky not available, skipping hook
"
`;

